# Paste ONE key on the matching line. The provider is picked from the key automatically.
#   xAI Grok  -> key starts with xai-  (console.x.ai)
#   Groq      -> key starts with gsk_  (console.groq.com)
# This file stays on your computer. Never share it, commit it, or paste it into a chat.
AI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model. Defaults: grok-4.7 (xAI) or llama-3.3-70b-versatile (Groq).
# AI_MODEL=
# PORT=8000
